1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Your gas mileage is dropping

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
and you don't know why.

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Idle feels a little rough.

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Check engine light comes on, then maybe goes off.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,500
One clue: a failing oxygen sensor.

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:15,000
It can send the wrong reading to the engine computer.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
That can richen the fuel mix —

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
burning more gas than you need to.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Don't guess which part it is.

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
A scan tool can help narrow it down.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Worth checking before it costs you more at the pump.

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Stop by and we'll take a look — Nick's Tire & Auto.
